## Safety

The on-chain safety rails (`on-chain-safety-rails` skill) take
precedence over everything in this skill. No seed phrase, private key,
or API key is stored in this repository; premium RPC endpoints belong
in `.env` (git-ignored, mode 600), never in code, docs, or logs.
